 an assembly of equipment or devices or a single device arranged to signal the presence of a hazard requiring urgent attention and to which law enforcement, fire or emergency medical personnel are expected to respond; provided, however, that this term includes externally audible and/or visual on-premises alarm systems but does not include smoke detectors and other alarms designated to merely give internal on-premises notification of an alarm condition.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"09fb8dd8-b270-5881-b706-08effc0f9208"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.15.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.15.010","content_hash":"38dcf6fe698555721fc633399916f10812e40914ae9a954b4b683f1c857ffab5","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.15.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.15.010:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.15.010","text":"“Chief of Police” means the Chief of Police of the City or a designated representative.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"bf237585-b0e6-5fd5-8d08-e3db412bea48"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.15.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.15.010","content_hash":"48d05b4512666c806d6751659ea68a942c120bf0fcb582bffeb27fff3fb0b090","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.15.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.15.010:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.15.010","text":"“City” means the City of Topeka, Kansas.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"07a84e14-ac32-58e6-b6e4-7ff757913d20"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.15.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.15.010","content_hash":"a40143031bf93bc6739b6